+ TruchetCanvas is Box

+ tile-radius Length = 20px
+ stroke-width Length = 1
+ seed U32 = 17u32
+ mix F64 = 0.5

. invalidate-paint < tile-radius, stroke-width, seed, mix

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Box ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint-self
    - canvas Canvas

canvas.push()
. content = content-bounds
canvas.translate(content.x, content.y)
. params = TruchetParams()
params.size = Dimensions(width, height)
params.tile-radius = tile-radius
params.stroke-width = stroke-width
params.seed = seed
params.mix = mix

if params.background
    canvas.fill-color = params.background
    canvas.stroke-color = null
    canvas.rect(Rect(0, 0, width, height))

. scene = truchet-artwork(params)
scene.background = null
scene.render(canvas)
canvas.pop()
